# Douban / 豆瓣 (cookie-bearing web, mobile web and App/API hosts only)
#
# Covers:
# - Desktop web: www.douban.com, movie.douban.com, book.douban.com, music.douban.com
# - Mobile web: m.douban.com
# - App/API paths under douban.com, including Frodo app entry
# - douban.fm
#
# The cookieless image CDN doubanio.com is intentionally NOT listed here: it
# falls through to china-direct (DIRECT), matching the mulanshan sing-box
# gateway, so image traffic does not consume the cookie-sync exit bandwidth.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,douban.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,douban.fm
